{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50181","headline":"辛四卧病舟中羣公招登慈和寺 · 丘爲","name":"辛四卧病舟中羣公招登慈和寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳色扁舟带水阴，闻君卧疾引登临。\n凭高始见三吴势，望远因知四海心。\n山僧午後清禅洽，羣木晴初绿霭深。\n云外翩翩飞鸟尽，令人宛自动归吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}